# Maintainer-local notes (workspaces, plans, consumer list, catalog
# maintenance skills). _local/ is its own git repository with a private remote.
_local/

# Issue tracker (markdown issues per feature) until the repo is opened and
# issues move to GitHub Issues.
.scratch/

